# Urban Transport Profitability Analysis

## Objective

This project analyzes the operational profitability of an urban transport fleet through fuel consumption evaluation, passenger demand analysis, and efficient vehicle allocation strategies.

The main objective is to identify operational inefficiencies and optimize resource utilization using data-driven decision making.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook

## Business KPIs

- Fuel consumption per vehicle
- Cost per route
- Passenger occupancy rate
- Operational efficiency
- Route profitability

## Key Insights

- Detection of underutilized routes
- Identification of high fuel consumption units
- Demand variability analysis
- Fleet allocation optimization opportunities

